'''Splash''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 3]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
The blade uses a splash texture, hence the name. Its blade is red in color by the tip, which then fades into a bright blue with pink tints. The guard is pink in color, and the handle is solid black. The unreleased version appears visually identical in the exception that its blade is green and pink in color instead of red and blue.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Splash (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*Splash’s unreleased version was published to the Roblox Library by [[Nikilis]] on April 22, 2021.<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/6711939181/Splash The model of the unreleased version]</ref>

